      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Shared synthesis of complexes 1–3: 0.2 mmol H2L (42.6 mg) and 0.1 mmol (15.2 mg) o-vanillin were taken in 3 mL dry dichloromethane and 3 mL methanol, 0.4 mmol (68 μL) triethylamine was added, and the mixture was stirred for 1 h. In another vial, 0.1 mmol Cu(NO3)2·6H2O and 0.1 mmol Ln(NO3)3·6H2O (Ln = Gd for 1) were dissolved in 3 mL dry dichloromethane and 3 mL methanol. This solution was added to the ligand solution, giving an immediate green precipitate. The mixture was stirred for 3–4 h, heated for 15 min, filtered hot, and kept in a refrigerator for slow evaporation. Square-shaped green crystals of 1 formed after a day.",
